### TC-14A: Uji Parameter ID Non-Numerik (Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php?id=abc
Accept: application/json

### TC-14B: Uji Update Harga Bernilai Negatif (Ekspektasi: 422 Unprocessable Entity)
### Catatan: Jalankan request Login Admin terlebih dahulu agar sesi aktif
PUT http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php?id=1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "harga": -50000
}


